<title>UK: Dresdner unit sets NZ$100 mln 4-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner unit sets NZ$100 mln 4-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.75	MATURITY    19.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.125   PAY DATE    19.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p>MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AA+ DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		DRESDNER KLEINWORT BENSON IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
